<Base title="Privacy Policy | CalcSolver.info" description="How CalcSolver.info handles calculations, local game scores and external activity providers."><div class="page-shell"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span> / </span><span>Privacy</span></nav><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="page-lead">Last updated: September 30, 2026</p><div class="article-body"><h2>Your calculations</h2><p>Calculator expressions are processed in your browser. This version of the site does not send your calculator input or results to a calculation server.</p><h2>Local game scores</h2><p>The local 2048 and Snake games may save your best score in your browser’s local storage. The score is not linked to an account. Clearing this website’s browser storage removes saved scores.</p><h2>External activities and images</h2><p>Some activity images and games load from third-party providers. Requests to these services may include technical information such as your IP address, browser details and a referring website address. Those providers may use cookies, advertising or analytics under their own policies.</p><p>You can use the main calculator and select the local games without opening an external game. Local games are marked LOCAL in the activity directory.</p><h2>Hosting and fonts</h2><p>The hosting provider may process normal request logs to deliver and protect the website. The site uses fonts served by Google Fonts; your browser makes a request to that service when loading a page.</p><h2>Advertising and analytics</h2><p>This version does not include a first-party advertising or analytics service. An external game may include its provider’s own advertising and measurement tools. This policy should be updated if the website’s data practices change.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Visit the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for available support information.</p></div></div></Base>
